---
const categories = ['Island cruises','Snorkelling','Culture & villages','Adventure','Fishing','Nature'];
---
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<meta name="description" content="Start your Fiji journey with locally operated tours and transfers. Transparent prices in Fijian dollars, booking-status clarity and planned human plus AI support." />
<meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" />
<title>BulaBooking | Start Your Fiji Journey</title>
<style>
:root{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;color:#143238;background:#f6fbfa}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}a{color:inherit}header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px max(5%,calc((100% - 1100px)/2));background:#fff}header strong{font-size:1.35rem;color:#087b73}nav{display:flex;gap:20px}main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:0 24px}.hero{padding:80px 0 55px;max-width:800px}.eyebrow{font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#087b73;font-size:.8rem}h1{font-size:clamp(2.6rem,6vw,5rem);line-height:1.07;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:20px 0}h2{font-size:2rem;letter-spacing:-.025em}p{line-height:1.6;color:#4a6468}.cta{display:inline-block;padding:15px 22px;border-radius:12px;background:#087b73;color:white;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;margin:10px 10px 0 0}.cta.alt{background:white;color:#087b73;border:1px solid #a9d5d0}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}.tile{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d7e8e5;border-radius:18px;padding:24px;min-height:125px}.tile strong{font-size:1.1rem}section{margin:35px 0 75px}.notice{background:#e7f4f1;border-radius:14px;padding:18px;font-size:.9rem}.support{background:#e7f4f1;border-radius:20px;padding:26px}.support h2{margin-top:0}footer{padding:35px 24px;text-align:center;border-top:1px solid #d7e8e5}@media(max-width:650px){nav{gap:10px;font-size:.85rem}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.hero{padding:55px 0 35px}}@media(max-width:400px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header><strong>BulaBooking<span style="color:#e99b37">.</span></strong><nav aria-label="Main"><a href="#explore">Explore</a><a href="#support">Support</a><a href="#operators">Operators</a></nav></header>
<main>
<section class="hero"><div class="eyebrow">Fiji experiences · All prices in FJD</div><h1>Start your Fiji journey.<br/>Book now with confidence.</h1><p>Discover tours, activities and transfers across Fiji. See clear prices in Fijian dollars, understand what is included and know exactly when your booking is confirmed.</p><a class="cta" href="#explore">Explore Fiji experiences</a><a class="cta alt" href="#support">How support works</a><p class="notice"><strong>Development preview:</strong> Listings and bookings are not yet active. This page does not accept reservations or connect to a support team.</p></section>
<section id="explore"><h2>Explore Fiji your way</h2><div class="grid">{categories.map(category => <article class="tile"><strong>{category}</strong><p>Verified operator experiences coming soon</p></article>)}</div></section>
<section class="support" id="support"><div class="eyebrow">Human + AI travel support</div><h2>Real people when it matters. AI assistance for quick answers.</h2><p>Our planned service connects AI assistance for common questions with a real-time WhatsApp human support team, designed for 24/7 coverage. Live availability and response-time commitments must be verified before launch.</p><p><strong>Booking clarity:</strong> A request is not a confirmation. Your booking becomes confirmed only after the operator accepts it. You will be shown the current status and applicable cancellation terms.</p><p><strong>All prices in FJD:</strong> Every displayed tour or transfer price will be denominated in Fijian dollars. No automatic currency conversion or hidden exchange-rate markup.</p><p class="notice">WhatsApp and AI chat are not connected in this preview. No live-support button is shown until the approved support channel is configured and tested.</p></section>
<section id="operators"><div class="eyebrow">For Fiji operators</div><h2>Your business. Your prices. Your customers.</h2><p>Open to qualifying independent Fiji operators, including competitors of our affiliated businesses. The proposed platform offers zero tour commissions, AI-assisted listing drafts, and direct booking requests.</p><a class="cta alt" href="/operators/start/">Try the local listing studio</a><p>Listing studio is a non-persistent preview. Operator verification and live publishing are not active.</p></section>
<section><h2>Transfers for your Fiji journey</h2><p>Dedicated transfers will be provided through our affiliated NAT/FijiDash services, with clear disclosure and FJD fares. Tour operators can still offer experiences with their own included transport. The transfer booking integration is not active in this preview.</p></section>
</main><footer>BulaBooking · Fiji marketplace development preview · No live bookings or chat</footer>
</body></html>